#: TopWidget.cpp:402
msgid ""
"<p>Click on the checkboxes to <strong>show</strong> or <strong>hide</strong> "
"runlevels.</p> <p>The list of currently visible runlevels is saved when you "
"use the <strong>Save Options command</strong>.</p>"
